proposal = "In block/catchup/bound_interval_supervisor.ex require the current ref for every result, demonitor/flush it before clearing task, and safely ignore stale DOWN/result messages. Add a task-result-plus-DOWN sequence for timeout, unreachable and refused errors proving one replacement and no supervisor crash."
