observed = "maybe_set_new_log_index detects duplicate RPC log indices within a block, sorts logs and assigns fresh sequential indices to all of them. Those invented indices flow into logs and token/market-event imports, so the explorer can publish event identities that were never committed by the node and conceal an inconsistent or duplicate receipt response."
